        "purpose": "profile-update",
        "grant_jti": "grant-01JTEST000000000000000000",
        "consent_exp": 1900000050
      },
      "expected": "accept",
      "reason": "Action strings are opaque and exact; whether a Storage route implements delete is component policy."
    },
    {
